'''Ammanford Association Football Club''' is a [[association football|football]] club from [[Ammanford]], [[Carmarthenshire]] in Wales. They play in the {{Welsh football updater|Ammanfd}}. They are now based at the Recreation Ground in Ammanford. The club is affiliated to the [[Football Association of Wales]] (FAW) and the [[West Wales Football Association]] (WWFA)."}}
